### ============================================================
### Aniimo Webshop - UID Top-Up API (Region Taiwan / TWD / MyCard)
### Base URL: http://localhost:3001
### ============================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3001

### 1. Health Check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### 2. Get Reverse Engineering Packet Inspection Report
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/aniimo/reverse-engineering/analysis

### 3. Get Game Server List
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/aniimo/servers

### 4. Get Game Packages (Locked to Region Taiwan & TWD)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/aniimo/packages

### ============================================================
### Character Name Verification (UID Top-Up)
### ============================================================

### 5. Verify Character (Valid UID from Exam - Sweettoast Lv. 80 Server 4)
# @name verifyCharacter
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/aniimo/verify
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "uid": "412000126173",
  "server": "4"
}

### 6. Verify Character on Server 1
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/aniimo/verify
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "uid": "412000126173",
  "server": "1"
}

### 7. Verify Character - Invalid format (Non-numeric / Too short -> 400 Bad Request)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/aniimo/verify
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "uid": "INVALID_UID",
  "server": "4"
}

### 8. Verify Character - Character Not Found (UID ending in 000 -> 400 Bad Request)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/aniimo/verify
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "uid": "99999999000",
  "server": "4"
}

### ============================================================
### Order Creation & MyCard Billing Session
### ============================================================

### 9. Create Top-Up Order (300 Stars Package - 138 TWD via MyCard Points)
# @name createOrder
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/aniimo/order/create
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "uid": "412000126173",
  "server": "4",
  "packageId": "PKG-300",
  "paymentChannel": "MyCard Points"
}

### 10. Query Created Order Status
@sampleOrderId = {{createOrder.response.body.data.orderId}}
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/aniimo/order/{{sampleOrderId}}

### 11. Create Top-Up Order (Starter 60 Stars Package - 28 TWD)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/aniimo/order/create
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "uid": "412000126173",
  "server": "4",
  "packageId": "PKG-60",
  "paymentChannel": "MyCard Points"
}
